 "verdict": "include",
 "verdict_reason": "Own replication: SLB-style rule defined on one Sp/Sa orientation recovered by the other at 0.80 (69 pos, pooled over library x line); replicate-to-replicate 2%-tail split 0.77 mean (0.79-0.99 in the 5 SynLet lines with signal); author calls vs single orientation 0.97. Same-line cross-study with included sources (Dede 2020, Chou 2025, Flister 2025 in A549/HT-29/OVCAR-8/A375/MEL-JUSO): 0.81 for our labels (11 pos) and 0.83 for theirs (9 pos). Only Ito 2021 disagrees (0.22, 4 pos), a source SLB already excludes as contradicted. Hit rate 0.6-0.7% (17 positives). Fitness-only 0.71-0.74 (<0.8). Caveat: a tiny designed panel (51 genes, 781 unique pairs); positives are 15/17 paralogs and repeat the same pairs across lines (BCL2L1-MCL1 x5, MAPK1-MAPK3 x5, BCL2L1-BCL2L2 x3), so the source adds little family diversity."
}